{"availability":"available","full":"alexkroman/tiny-audio","name":"tiny-audio","description":"A speech-to-text system you can train for $25. A frozen speech encoder and a Qwen LLM joined by a small trained projector, with word timestamps, speaker diarization, a batched HTTP server, a live demo, and a free course.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":173,"forks":18,"created":"2025-10-14T02:20:00Z","updated":"2026-10-17T20:56:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mazesmazes/tiny-audio","topics":["asr","audio-llm","forced-alignment","huggingface","llm","lora","multimodal","pipecat","pytorch","qwen","runpod","speaker-diarization","speech-llm","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","transformers","turn-detection","tutorial","voice-ai","word-timestamps"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/mazesmazes/tiny-audio","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:54.072Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:54.072Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T21:14:54.072Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.217Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.663Z","stars":153,"forks":16},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.217Z","stars":166,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:14:54.072Z","stars":173,"forks":18}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A speech-to-text system you can train for $25.","Tiny Audio connects a frozen, pretrained speech encoder to a pretrained LLM with a small trainable projector. The model published from this repo gets 1.8% WER on LibriSpeech test-clean and 7.4% across 12 benchmarks (11,822 samples pooled) while training only 80M parameters. The codebase is small enough to read in an afternoon, and you can run a training loop on your laptop in about five minutes."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alexkroman/tiny-audio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f681a22940f0098edf8d92609ceaf363bb1fc09e50fe95d0f19efad44a865ce3","ext